---
description: Keep image paste actions explicit and scoped to a selected upload slot
globs: tools/*.html
alwaysApply: false
---

# Image paste targeting

- Image paste handlers must write only to an explicitly selected image upload slot. A dedicated numbered step or paste-target selector may set the destination.
- Do not infer the paste destination from a text field's focus, and do not choose a default destination.
- Show the active destination in the interface and provide clear feedback when an image is pasted without a selected destination.
- Keep ordinary text pastes in text fields unaffected.
